  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="13">[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="13" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ sy ælc cyrice on Godes griþe ⁊ on þæs cynges ⁊ on ealles Cristenes folces.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And sy ælc cyrice on Godes griþe and on þæs cynges and on ealles Cristenes folces.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And every church shall be under the special protection of God and of the king and of all Christian people.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And each church shall be under the protection of God and of the king and of all Christian people.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und jede Kirche stehe im Friedensschutze Gottes und des Königs und alles christlichen Volkes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let every church be under the protection of God and of the king and of all Christian people.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
